<title>AUSTRALIA: S.Pattinson half yr net profit A$20.18 mln.</title>
<headline>S.Pattinson half yr net profit A$20.18 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    44.21 vs 45.48</p>
<p>    Net				     20.18 vs 19.26</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     30.0 vs 25.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Washington H. Soul Pattinson &amp; Co Ltd has operations in pharmaceutical manufacturing, wholesale and retailing, coal mining, television and property. The result includes earnings from its 50 percent owned Brickworks Ltd.</p>
</text>
